{{Term/Store|Russ||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring character in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|Russ|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Russ|Game Screen|TotK}}</ref>

==Biography==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Russ is a member of the [[Shield Breakers]], a [[Shield Surfing]] gang, consisting of him and his friend [[Fin]].<ref>{{Cite|It's cause we're members of the {{Color BotW|Red|shield-surfing}} gang, the Shield Breakers!|Russ|BotW}}</ref> He asks [[Link]] to buy from the selection of [[Shield]]s he has, which are used for Shield Surfing. If Link purchases a Shield, he tells him about the [[Hylian Shield]], which he thinks would be perfect for Surfing with.<ref>{{Cite|Oh! Speaking of not breaking, have ya heard about the {{Color BotW|Blue|Hylian shield}}? Everyone in the surfing scene covets that bad boy.|Russ|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|It's clearly commissioned by the royal family or somethin'! It's sturdiness makes it perfect for shield surfing too.|Russ|BotW}}</ref> After discussing the Shield, he tells Link that there is a rumor of one being in [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]].<ref>{{Cite|You don't really see 'em around these days... but rumor has it there's one in {{Color BotW|Blue|Hyrule Castle}}.|Russ|BotW}}</ref>

