Russ and [[Fin]] went to [[Selmie's Spot]] the receive [[Shield Surfing]] training from her, but due to the blizzard over [[Hebra Mountains]], they can't go outside though.<ref>{{Cite|Hey, maaan! You come here to do some shield surfing? Or maybe to ask Selmie if she'd take you on as a student, like us?|Fin|TotK}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|But this blizzard... We can't train in this weather, so we can't learn our way to mastering what's she's got to teach!|Russ|TotK}}</ref> When [[Link]] arrives there, he recommends he should return once the weather conditions improved, as [[Selmie]] might take other students by then.<ref>{{Cite|Sounds like Teach won't take more students. At least, until the blizzard cuts it out or something.|Russ|TotK}}</ref> When spoken to again he advices Link to watch for flags in the vicinity, as they contain [[Flint]] and [[Wood]] which help create a [[Campfire]]. <ref>{{Cite|When you're out there, keep an eye out for flags on the mountain. There's flint and firewood under 'em to help shield surfers stay warm.|Russ|TotK}}</ref> He wields a [[Wooden Shield]].

